  "description": "A winding stone path enters a woodland of oversized mushrooms, luminous pools and richly coloured flowers. Tall blue mushroom caps shelter the upper-left bank, with smaller pink and purple caps rising below them. A cluster of violet crystals stands farther up the path. Round turquoise pools dotted with floating leaves fill the hollows between the stones, and pale waterfalls shine along the right-hand tree line. Small points of golden light hang beneath the canopy. The ordinary greens of the forest give way here to saturated blues, violet stone and flowers as large as the surrounding leaves.",
